## Application Setup

Keep Application creation in `src/utils/app.js`. **v8 initialization is async** — export the app instance plus an `initApp()` function, and await it in `main.js` before touching the stage.

```js
// utils/app.js
import { Application } from 'pixi.js';
import { config } from '@/config/config';

export const app = new Application();

export async function initApp() {
  await app.init({
    background: config.app.background,
    antialias: config.app.antialias,
    resolution: config.app.resolution,
    autoDensity: config.app.autoDensity,
    preference: config.app.preference,
    resizeTo: window,
  });

  document.body.appendChild(app.canvas);
  return app;
}

export const stage = app.stage;
```

- `app.canvas` — not `app.view` (v7 name)
- `autoDensity: true` keeps CSS size correct on high-DPI displays
- Cap `resolution` at 2 — beyond that costs fill rate for no visible gain

