## Text

```js
import { Text, TextStyle } from 'pixi.js';

const scoreStyle = new TextStyle({
  fontFamily: 'Arial',
  fontSize: 36,
  fill: '#ffffff',
  stroke: { color: '#000000', width: 4 },
});

export const scoreText = new Text({ text: 'Score: 0', style: scoreStyle });
scoreText.anchor.set(0.5, 0);
```

- Define `TextStyle` objects once in `config/` and reuse them — creating a style per Text object wastes memory
- Updating `.text` regenerates the texture. For values changing every frame (timers, counters), use **BitmapText** instead
- Set `resolution` on text if it looks blurry after scaling

