## Global State

Use a single plain object in `src/store/state.js`. No reactive framework needed.

```js
// store/state.js
export const state = {
  isPaused: false,
  score: 0,
  enemies: [],
  pickups: [],
};
```

Cache display object references in a separate `store/refs.js`:

```js
// store/refs.js
export const refs = {
  player: null, // Set after scene setup
  scoreText: null,
};
```

