## Object Pooling

Anything spawned repeatedly (bullets, particles, enemies) must be pooled. Allocating and destroying display objects per-spawn causes GC stutter.

```js
// utils/pool.js
export function createPool(factory, initialSize = 20) {
  const available = [];

  for (let i = 0; i < initialSize; i++) available.push(factory());

  return {
    get() {
      const item = available.pop() ?? factory();
      item.visible = true;
      return item;
    },
    release(item) {
      item.visible = false;
      item.parent?.removeChild(item);
      available.push(item);
    },
  };
}
```

