## Custom Events

Use native browser events for decoupled communication between systems:

```js
// Dispatch
window.dispatchEvent(new Event('game:ready'));
window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('score:changed', { detail: { score } }));

// Listen
window.addEventListener('game:ready', () => {
  /* ... */
});
```

Use a namespace prefix (`game:`, `ui:`, `player:`) to avoid collisions.

